-- Ready-made triathlon and duathlon plans for the Plans page, 2026-10-26.
-- Generated with buildMultiPlan() from plan-kit.js against the shared ride library, the same
-- generator the plan builder uses, so runs, swims, bricks and race day are stored inline exactly
-- as builder plans store them. Pool swims only (no open-water sessions). Each plan ends with race
-- day on its last Sunday; following a plan starts it the next Monday, so race day lands then.
on conflict (id) do nothing;
